Z||000000||DXR_DAD||10-18-1999||11:28 PM||||Has anyone replaced all the sensors in their car at one time? or can anyone give me a list of all of them and part #.<P>Thanks||||reg||5
Z||000001||Carrolles||10-19-1999||07:19 AM||||Hi,<BR>FOCOA ran a four part article on stroking the 2.8L engine a while back.  Here are the sensors that were listed in the article.<P>Oil pressure/fuel pump switch<BR>P/N 10045775<P>Fan coolant sensor<BR>P/N 3040674<P>Manifold air temperature<BR>P/N 25036751<P>ECM Coolant temp sensor<BR>P/N 25036979<P>Throttle position sensor<BR>P/N 10106063<P>Idle air control<BR>P/N 25527077<P>Oxygen sonsor<BR>P/N 25162693<P>EGR Control valve<BR>P/N 10038324<P>Manifold air pressure sensor<BR>P/N 16137039<P>Cold start control<BR>P/N 14084318<P>Even though I'm installing a stock rebuilt long block I use the article for reference.<P>Hope this helps,<BR>Carroll||||reg||1
